From 55cd257834a6e09299eb41c47d28872c82f3bb25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:14:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] gamespace: add custom mode with resolution and fps limit

The per app downscale goes to Settings.Secure game_overlay, which
GameManagerService never reads, so games always ran at full size and
there was no way to cap the frame rate. Add the custom game mode and
show resolution and frame rate options for it, saved through
updateCustomGameModeConfiguration. Frame rates are the divisors of the
display refresh rates that are 30 or more.
